WEBVTT

00:02.810 --> 00:08.110
I'll show you the Love Spell humans feared.

00:16.990 --> 00:21.000
<b>Love Spell
Knightfall</b>

00:24.560 --> 00:28.420
Adonis, you'll move free 
of gravity's constraints.

00:28.840 --> 00:30.760
No one can stop you now.

00:31.940 --> 00:35.000
All your wounds have closed.

00:35.260 --> 00:38.040
Your bones aren't broken.

00:39.670 --> 00:43.440
Your magic is limitless!

00:46.920 --> 00:48.520
This is bad!

00:58.200 --> 01:00.790
<b>Quinblade</b>

00:58.860 --> 01:00.630
Quinblade.

01:09.740 --> 01:11.480
As you wish...

01:13.420 --> 01:14.320
princess.

03:04.280 --> 03:07.040
<i>She's increasing his magical 
strength through suggestion.</i>

03:22.820 --> 03:25.800
<i>It's not just his magical strength?</i>

03:34.310 --> 03:36.160
You can't be serious.

03:37.690 --> 03:40.640
These hands hurt the princess.

03:53.770 --> 03:56.840
These legs defiled her.

04:21.600 --> 04:25.520
Wait. Time-out.

04:46.130 --> 04:47.990
Not even your bones will remain.

05:25.320 --> 05:26.760
Snow?

05:29.880 --> 05:35.540
Chloe once used this spell 
to end a hundred-year drought.

05:38.180 --> 05:40.220
I promised her...

05:41.490 --> 05:45.940
that I'd only use this spell 
to protect another.

05:48.940 --> 05:51.400
Whoa now.

06:01.300 --> 06:05.920
Written-Style Summoning 
Magic: Ritual of Ruin.

06:07.420 --> 06:09.630
Give me a break!

06:30.160 --> 06:32.570
Make him stop.

06:32.830 --> 06:35.820
Hey! Make him stop, witch!

06:36.360 --> 06:38.830
Do you want to die with him?

06:39.200 --> 06:43.580
A human body can't withstand this spell!

06:44.120 --> 06:45.360
It's all right.

06:46.540 --> 06:48.290
He won't freeze.

06:51.980 --> 06:54.740
Because he's enveloped in scorching flames.

06:57.250 --> 06:58.130
Right?

07:02.130 --> 07:05.350
She used suggestion to start a fire?

07:05.350 --> 07:07.360
This doesn't make any sense!

07:07.360 --> 07:11.360
Damn it!

07:28.890 --> 07:30.820
Spell complete.

07:45.810 --> 07:48.900
<b>Absolute Zero</b>

07:57.320 --> 07:58.520
Damn it.

08:00.450 --> 08:02.140
This wasn't supposed to happen.

08:04.360 --> 08:06.680
<i>Sir, run!</i>

08:07.570 --> 08:08.930
<i>Sir!</i>

08:46.070 --> 08:51.210
Hey, is it me or did it just 
get cold all of a sudden?

08:57.010 --> 08:57.960
What?

09:03.170 --> 09:05.030
What the hell is that?

09:07.230 --> 09:11.160
Boys, take shelter!

09:11.160 --> 09:13.480
Move it!

09:13.770 --> 09:15.400
What's going on?

09:15.400 --> 09:17.980
It doesn't matter. Just do as Punch says.

09:18.280 --> 09:20.720
Hurry! Something bad is coming!

09:25.240 --> 09:27.500
Is it a storm?

09:27.980 --> 09:31.010
No, it's raining ice!

09:35.570 --> 09:38.360
Our drones are badly damaged. 
We've lost video.

09:38.360 --> 09:41.040
We've lost the signal
 from our recon aircraft, too.

09:41.040 --> 09:45.050
We're unable to monitor the target 
and Director Shirousagi.

09:45.050 --> 09:48.460
Meteorological satellites 
are picking up a large-scale spell

09:48.460 --> 09:51.400
and a sudden drop in temperature 
at their coordinates.

09:51.400 --> 09:55.570
We've lost the director's vitals, too. 
It's unclear if he's dead or alive.

09:55.570 --> 09:57.890
Switching to satellite image.

10:01.050 --> 10:05.600
Wh-What is this?

10:06.910 --> 10:09.420
Coordinates 36N
 Dash 39


 Immeasurable
 Abnormality 
Detected

10:09.410 --> 10:13.920
I see. No wonder the National Security 
Bureau had so much trouble with him.

10:18.610 --> 10:19.980
Director Oz.

10:19.980 --> 10:24.050
Taking down the witch's 
apprentice won't be easy.

10:32.490 --> 10:33.670
Did it stop?

10:33.670 --> 10:37.580
Hey, is everyone all right?

10:37.580 --> 10:39.600
So cold.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.540
What the hell was that?

10:41.540 --> 10:45.080
It doesn't snow around here.

10:47.360 --> 10:51.130
They're not actually dead, are they?

11:52.910 --> 11:56.690
<i>I promised her...</i>

11:58.680 --> 12:05.320
<i>that I'd only use my magic 
to protect another.</i>

12:30.770 --> 12:32.510
What is this?

12:33.960 --> 12:35.480
It's warm.

12:36.730 --> 12:38.560
Is it armor?

12:39.760 --> 12:42.530
Did you protect me?

12:44.850 --> 12:48.460
Princess...

12:50.580 --> 12:52.800
Dispel Love Spell.

13:15.450 --> 13:17.520
I'm so glad.

13:20.460 --> 13:24.560
You two look just like them.

13:27.160 --> 13:32.580
Like the young queen and him.

13:34.340 --> 13:39.330
If you see the queen, tell her...

13:39.810 --> 13:43.340
Though I failed to acquire the Incarnation,

13:43.830 --> 13:49.910
I... I did my best.

13:53.200 --> 13:55.200
The ensembleverse...

13:57.600 --> 13:59.840
Somewhere out there...

14:08.290 --> 14:13.040
perhaps there was a world 
where we could've been together.

14:14.840 --> 14:16.700
<i>The Incarnation...</i>

14:18.960 --> 14:20.620
Doroka.

14:23.350 --> 14:24.480
What is it?

14:25.210 --> 14:28.270
I'll fix your eyes.

14:30.280 --> 14:31.640
Adonis...

14:48.750 --> 14:50.990
Huh? Isn't that...

14:51.390 --> 14:52.740
Could it be?

14:52.740 --> 14:54.360
What? Is it really her?

14:54.360 --> 14:55.370
No way.

14:56.920 --> 14:59.000
It's Queen Dorothea.

14:59.000 --> 15:00.640
Her Majesty?

15:00.640 --> 15:01.800
Where?

15:02.750 --> 15:03.960
Wow.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.240
It's the queen.

15:05.240 --> 15:07.420
Her Majesty Queen Dorothea.

15:07.420 --> 15:09.510
Hey, don't push me.

15:09.700 --> 15:12.030
Oh, wow. I gotta take a picture.

15:12.030 --> 15:14.020
She's so cute.

15:14.020 --> 15:16.770
Look. It's the queen.

15:17.140 --> 15:19.760
Queen Dorothea!

15:20.160 --> 15:23.030
There she is. It's Queen Dorothea.

15:23.610 --> 15:27.280
Camera, zoom in on the queen 
and broadcast to the studio.

15:27.280 --> 15:29.680
Wow, it's really her.

15:29.680 --> 15:31.790
She's out for a morning jog.

15:43.040 --> 15:48.300
Hello, citizens. Good morning.

15:55.540 --> 15:56.920
What a workout.

15:56.920 --> 16:00.800
Your Majesty, did you go 
into the city again?

16:00.800 --> 16:04.970
Forgive me, but you are the queen.

16:04.970 --> 16:07.240
If you would allow some 
guards to escort you...

16:07.240 --> 16:09.320
You worry too much.

16:10.130 --> 16:12.870
Everyone loves me.

16:12.870 --> 16:15.320
I'm not in any danger.

16:15.320 --> 16:19.460
More importantly, have we received 
a response from the Crowns yet?

16:19.460 --> 16:21.590
I'm tired of waiting.

16:21.590 --> 16:24.590
I'll send them a message 
requesting a response.

16:24.590 --> 16:26.360
One moment, please.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.570
Okay.

16:28.110 --> 16:30.080
Don't forget to tell them.

16:31.800 --> 16:34.600
If they won't listen to my request...

16:40.600 --> 16:42.850
Military Nation Mika

16:43.940 --> 16:46.350
Eastern Nation Suzure

16:53.650 --> 16:56.610
Markpoint Medical Nation

16:57.410 --> 17:00.490
Single Mother Nation Orionsono

17:05.640 --> 17:08.830
...I'll declare war on them.

17:22.100 --> 17:24.010
Th-Thank you.

17:24.010 --> 17:26.940
It's fine. It's my fault anyway.

17:26.940 --> 17:28.770
You're right.

17:28.770 --> 17:31.520
It's because you froze everything.

17:39.150 --> 17:42.500
I cast my Love Spell on you.

17:46.200 --> 17:53.030
Your heart and the feelings 
you held onto for Chloe...

17:53.950 --> 17:58.160
Chloe's life is more precious 
than all of humanity.

17:58.160 --> 18:01.740
The world that took her from me
 deserves to be destroyed.

18:03.810 --> 18:06.230
I directed them towards me.

18:08.150 --> 18:09.520
You're worried about that now?

18:09.520 --> 18:10.200
Huh?

18:10.200 --> 18:12.920
I'm the one who told you to do it.

18:12.920 --> 18:16.930
In actuality, that rabbit bastard 
was monstrously strong.

18:17.300 --> 18:21.950
I hate to admit it, but I couldn't 
have beaten him in a fair fight.

18:22.520 --> 18:25.940
I'm responsible for 
underestimating his strength.

18:26.330 --> 18:27.660
But...

18:28.120 --> 18:29.820
Lift your bangs.

18:29.820 --> 18:30.880
What?

18:31.130 --> 18:32.630
Just do it.

18:32.630 --> 18:33.680
Huh?

18:35.120 --> 18:36.630
What?

18:39.350 --> 18:44.150
I can't really tell, 
but it's pretty bad, right?

18:44.620 --> 18:47.420
Sorry I'm hideous.

18:48.570 --> 18:50.850
I'm responsible for this, too.

18:51.810 --> 18:53.280
Sorry.

18:56.470 --> 18:57.900
Fifteen times.

18:58.600 --> 18:59.360
What?

18:59.360 --> 19:01.290
The number of times you've said that.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.550
Oh, you mean "sorry"?

19:04.910 --> 19:06.660
That's 16.

19:07.500 --> 19:11.360
I think I'm starting to understand you.

19:12.360 --> 19:13.310
What?

19:13.310 --> 19:16.170
You're clumsy, easily frightened, 
and honestly, a bit of a hindrance.

19:16.170 --> 19:17.710
That's so mean!

19:18.210 --> 19:23.680
I genuinely believed that, 
but your kindness is real.

19:30.870 --> 19:32.430
Adonis?

19:33.330 --> 19:35.770
I take back calling you a hypocrite,

19:36.600 --> 19:41.780
so... will you share your kindness with me?

19:41.780 --> 19:42.930
What?

19:43.320 --> 19:47.580
Anyway, you're gonna have 
a tough time if you don't grow a spine.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.530
I know.

19:49.600 --> 19:50.940
Is that too tight?

19:50.940 --> 19:53.840
No, I'm fine.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.520
Let me know if it hurts.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.160
Hey.

20:02.080 --> 20:08.990
This kind of feels like you're holding me.

20:15.560 --> 20:17.730
I'm injured, you know!

20:17.730 --> 20:19.700
Don't get ahead of yourself.

20:19.700 --> 20:21.560
Chloe's the only one for me.

20:22.240 --> 20:25.820
Your Love Spell had no effect on me.

20:29.790 --> 20:31.570
Right.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.570
Anyway, there's no reason to stay here.

20:35.000 --> 20:37.350
We'll leave once we've packed our things.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.420
Okay.

20:40.300 --> 20:44.390
I didn't think we'd get another 
chance to use that stupid tent.

20:44.840 --> 20:47.600
We should be grateful to Mr. Punch.

20:51.920 --> 20:53.060
Huh?

20:54.610 --> 20:57.560
Oh, I'm sorry.

21:00.780 --> 21:03.360
Um, your hand...

21:05.200 --> 21:07.120
Mr. Adonis?

21:09.090 --> 21:10.940
Say something!

21:12.080 --> 21:15.870
I'll hold your hand since it's slippery.

21:15.870 --> 21:20.370
What? Are you sure?

21:20.370 --> 21:21.760
Yeah.

21:21.760 --> 21:27.130
A dumb witch once told me 
we should help each other.

21:28.390 --> 21:31.120
I agree.

23:33.630 --> 23:36.220
I won't let anyone else have him.

23:42.240 --> 23:46.480
I will avenge my brother.

23:51.940 --> 23:54.000
Hey, Adonis.

23:54.550 --> 23:56.000
What is it?

23:56.000 --> 23:59.030
I know now.

23:59.320 --> 24:00.240
Know what?

24:01.400 --> 24:04.000
That revenge isn't wrong.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.600
Oh, yeah?

24:07.120 --> 24:09.950
Yeah, definitely.
